---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  eyebrow="About"
  heading="One ownership. Tech, data, and 15+ years of know-how."
  sub="gtmWizards is founded and owned by the people behind hubsell and Kadanco. That is not a partnership or an integration, it is one house, and everything a modern outbound engine needs lives inside it."
  description="gtmWizards is owned by the founders of hubsell and Kadanco, outbound technology, B2B data, and senior European sales expertise under one roof."
>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why we started gtmWizards</h2>
      <p>
        After 15+ years building outbound technology and running campaigns
        across Europe, we kept seeing the same two failure modes: tools that
        demand expertise most teams don't have, and agencies that rent their
        tooling, hide their data sources, and design engagements you can
        never leave.
      </p>
      <p>
        gtmWizards is our answer to both. We run outbound as a fully managed
        service, but on <a href={SITE.hubsellUrl}>hubsell</a>, the platform
        we own, with data from <a href={SITE.kadancoUrl}>Kadanco</a>, the
        data company we own. Nothing is a black box, and nothing is designed
        to trap you.
      </p>
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Proof over claims.</strong> Our technology is a public
          product you can demo, not a slide in a pitch deck.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Seniors do the work.</strong> Campaigns are planned and
          run by experienced operators. We never sell seniority and deliver
          juniors.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Language is strategy.</strong> German, Dutch, and English:
          natively, because traditional European industries reply to people
          who sound like they belong.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>The best agency makes itself optional.</strong> Your data
          and campaigns live in your hubsell workspace from day one. When
          you're ready to in-source, we hand over the keys.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaSection
    heading="Talk to the people who will actually run your campaigns"
    sub="No SDR farm, no account-manager relay. A strategy call here is with a founder or senior operator."
  />
</PageLayout>
